===Etymology===
{{cal|en|as|ভোট-জলকীয়া||Bhutanese chili|tr=bhüt-zolokia}}. The first element {{m|as|ভোট||Bhutanese}} was mistakenly confused for the near-[[homonym]] {{m|as|ভূত||ghost}}, thus producing the English (mis-)translation "ghost pepper".<ref>''Merriam-Webster'', [https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/bhut+jolokia| Definition of BHUT JOLOKIA].</ref>

